      "cited_by": 0,
      "abstract": "This repository contains the frozen LFE_PIPELINE_v1 electrophysiology audit framework, adversarial controls, reproduction scripts, and replication results for Local Fracture Energy (LFE) in passive auditory mismatch negativity EEG paradigms. Analyses were conducted on ERP CORE (ds002778 / nm000132) and PURSUE (ds007069), totaling 316 retained subjects. The repository includes deterministic reproduction scripts, provenance snapshots, quality-control logs, known failure modes, and adversarial control analyses.",
